# hypr-dotfiles — KDE global settings
# ============================================================================
# On a non-Plasma session there is no systemsettings to "apply" a colour
# scheme, so the [Colors:*] blocks are inlined here — that is exactly what
# Plasma writes when you pick a scheme. KDE apps read this file directly.
#
# Generated from color-schemes/HyprMono.colors; keep the two in step.
